  m_text: 'Welcome to the Copy Game! Copy the Braille cell on the right by listening
    to the letter it says, or reading the cell visually. If you get it wrong, you''ll
    keep being asked until you get it right.


    You can turn off "Letter Mode"
    so that the audio speaks the dots you need to press, or disable showing the copy
    cell.


    You can press spacebar to repeat the letter.'
